{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"t":"PART 4","w":0.10301423390706381,"h":0.01635719489457077,"y":0.089931867506396479,"c":1,"x":0.067910359530873168},{"h":0.020592527300397956,"y":0.11638230488227863,"x":0.065886384985341995,"c":1,"t":"In today's astronomy lecture, I'm going to talk about the need for a system to manage the","w":0.70512573242187493},{"h":0.020565009191400252,"c":1,"t":"movement of satellites and other objects in orbit around the Earth. In other words, a Space","y":0.13337693313082921,"x":0.067824315908800947,"w":0.71484832763671879},{"c":1,"x":0.065889291276104753,"w":0.71480926513671872,"h":0.020061061538268476,"t":"Traffic Management system. We already have effective Air Traffic Control systems that are","y":0.14918680951922281},{"w":0.68543690999348961,"h":0.016026407164576706,"y":0.16715116287873688,"t":"used internationally to ensure that planes navigate our skies safely. Well, Space Traffic","c":1,"x":0.066019409248717409},{"h":0.018681069252275528,"c":1,"x":0.058192072006096683,"t":"Management is a similar concept, but focusing on the control of satellites.","w":0.59237085978190107,"y":0.18262370189862831},{"w":0.7128235371907552,"y":0.2053539561027411,"t":"The aim of such a system would be to prevent the danger of collisions in space between the","x":0.067869242200716356,"h":0.018264841810565202,"c":1},{"w":0.74191421508789068,"y":0.22270491389679126,"c":1,"x":0.065927077859946809,"t":"objects in orbit around the Earth. In order to do this, we'd need to have a set of legal measures,","h":0.019083614884135902},{"h":0.01761908724300576,"c":1,"y":0.239358482076937,"x":0.065920118349546239,"w":0.72249720255533856,"t":"and we'd also have to develop the technical systems to enable us to prevent such accidents."},{"c":1,"t":"But unfortunately, at present we don't actually have a Space Traffic Management system that","w":0.73616383870442703,"y":0.26287383891384231,"h":0.018573298706815344,"x":0.067843826658862558},{"w":0.58269994099934896,"h":0.018171847572207911,"c":1,"t":"works. So why not? What are the problems in developing such a system?","x":0.065940654137622332,"y":0.28019141581853546},{"w":0.74002614339192707,"y":0.30316259754465658,"t":"Well, for one thing, satellites are relatively cheap these days, compared with how they were in the","x":0.067858044443866367,"h":0.020245673871857384,"c":1},{"h":0.019453241223486795,"x":0.067821173806142762,"t":"past, meaning that more people can afford to put them into space. So there's a lot more of them","y":0.31884085474142143,"w":0.72839462280273437,"c":1},{"h":0.0199001454861365,"t":"out there, and people aren't just launching single satellites but whole constellations, consisting of","y":0.33538841015697129,"w":0.73619812011718744,"x":0.067839013955038746,"c":1},{"t":"thousands of them designed to work together. So space is getting more crowded every day.","x":0.067873352943824863,"h":0.019037505176579761,"c":1,"y":0.35232867776720489,"w":0.69726201375325514},{"t":"But in spite of this, one thing you may be surprised to learn is that you can launch a satellite","x":0.069789829205965645,"y":0.37611672918911276,"c":1,"w":0.72255976359049479,"h":0.019963506300501477},{"x":0.065894533422062737,"y":0.39106616998693555,"w":0.71679066975911465,"h":0.021275339096877399,"t":"into space and, once it's out there, it doesn't have to send back any information to Earth to","c":1},{"x":0.06788165043856699,"t":"allow its identification. So while we have international systems for ensuring we know where","y":0.40910319151446051,"w":0.71860448201497396,"h":0.017361019407848732,"c":1},{"x":0.067829274155518066,"t":"the planes in our skies are, and to prevent them from colliding with one another, when it","y":0.42429119175297925,"h":0.022775297075788625,"c":1,"w":0.69548395792643225},{"x":0.069771173527314351,"y":0.44115449487124725,"w":0.73030909220377604,"c":1,"h":0.019832751312731212,"t":"comes to the safety of satellites, at present we don't have anything like enough proper ways"},{"c":1,"t":"of tracking them.","w":0.13592233022054037,"h":0.013180105857017343,"x":0.069902912436787479,"y":0.46220930222932277},{"h":0.019652801584974622,"t":"And it isn't just entire satellites that we need to consider. A greater threat is the huge amount","c":1,"x":0.069786126287827321,"y":0.48164207553348359,"w":0.73034973144531246},{"y":0.49808691871388544,"w":0.67786890665690103,"c":1,"x":0.069802208116548359,"h":0.018087076917986944,"t":"of space debris in orbit around the Earth - broken bits of satellite and junk from space"},{"w":0.73419637044270836,"x":0.069808353161998196,"h":0.019434442252756257,"t":"stations and so on. And some of these are so small that they can be very hard to identify, but","c":1,"y":0.51439782498726538},{"t":"they can still be very dangerous.","w":0.2604383087158203,"h":0.017215579023985184,"c":1,"y":0.53242833404475198,"x":0.069759631514575801},{"y":0.55476278949361824,"w":0.7380264790852864,"c":1,"h":0.019815762837727902,"t":"In addition, some operators may be unwilling to share information about the satellites they've","x":0.069815230229070643},{"t":"launched. For example, a satellite may be designed for military purposes, or it may have","x":0.067961161874747184,"h":0.016006483987113018,"y":0.57122093030506182,"c":1,"w":0.69902913411458323},{"h":0.017887895055277658,"c":1,"t":"been launched for commercial reasons, and the operators don't want competitors to have","w":0.70505086263020833,"y":0.58700182031553805,"x":0.071753489180536908},{"y":0.60610465106596412,"c":1,"w":0.15922330220540365,"x":0.071844659535596045,"t":"information about it.","h":0.013209990623212708},{"y":0.62723551526564447,"c":1,"w":0.74002176920572915,"t":"And even if the operators are willing to provide it, the information isn't easy to collect. Details are","h":0.018695583521762815,"x":0.071736222997936541},{"w":0.73421284993489588,"c":1,"t":"needed about the object itself, as well as about its location at a particular time - and remember","y":0.64342377174762611,"h":0.01892403338185733,"x":0.069789169187405756},{"c":1,"w":0.70117492675781257,"t":"that a satellite isn't very big, and it's likely to be moving at thousands of kilometres an hour.","y":0.65864263527926314,"h":0.020024348939319259,"x":0.069777859388546332},{"c":1,"t":"We don't have any sensors that can constantly follow something moving so fast, so all that the","x":0.071748565141226947,"w":0.72641016642252598,"y":0.67553609987122243,"h":0.018640714865235886},{"c":1,"x":0.069830905006630056,"w":0.71470825195312504,"t":"scientists can do is to put forward a prediction concerning where the satellite is heading next.","y":0.69201043168461918,"h":0.017330942124221149},{"w":0.74000366210937496,"y":0.73784697747493844,"h":0.018962985481428607,"t":"So those are some of the problems that we're facing. Let's consider now some of the solutions","c":1,"x":0.071747708267388646},{"c":1,"x":0.07166054567293581,"w":0.70712773640950521,"t":"that have been suggested. One key issue is the way in which information is dealt with. We","y":0.7524778251730686,"h":0.02180089980271005},{"w":0.69721125284830732,"h":0.017978327148057249,"x":0.071786848104749335,"c":1,"y":0.77172918100636234,"t":"need more information, but it also needs to be accessible at a global level, so we need to"},{"t":"establish shared standards that we can all agree on for the way in which this information is","y":0.78733823891262344,"x":0.07176574856659447,"w":0.70890380859375002,"h":0.018189058868313124,"c":1},{"h":0.018105064819906369,"c":1,"x":0.071780901449462059,"y":0.80332752076653813,"w":0.71274785359700521,"t":"presented. We already do this in other areas of science, so although this is a challenge, it's"},{"w":0.73029963175455737,"h":0.019394682055321799,"x":0.07174249556225315,"c":1,"t":"not an impossible task. Then, as all this information's collected, it needs to be put together so","y":0.81868656513138416},{"c":1,"h":0.020947874075155748,"x":0.071710354515714655,"y":0.83452960841754065,"t":"it can be used, and that will involve creating a single database on which it can be entered.","w":0.70510025024414069},{"w":0.74194351196289066,"y":0.85986736024391508,"c":1,"t":"As we continue to push forward new developments, congestion of the space environment is only","h":0.019943679381753787,"x":0.07174609502738008},{"t":"going to increase. To cope with this, we need to develop a system like the one I've described to","h":0.020719759932188331,"c":1,"y":0.87469257525738542,"x":0.07171019883867577,"w":0.73229120890299482},{"t":"coordinate the work of the numerous spacecraft operators, but it's also essential that this system","w":0.7417475891113281,"x":0.071844652039980209,"h":0.016199376947040434,"c":1,"y":0.89376947045593669},{"c":1,"x":0.071844661639707819,"w":0.6815533955891927,"h":0.015988371899566145,"t":"is one that establishes trust in the people that use it, both nationally and at a globallevel.","y":0.90988372101630233},{"t":"One interesting development ..","y":0.93604651171780295,"h":0.015988371899566145,"x":0.073786401738350951,"c":1,"w":0.24854370117187502},{"y":0.03769470386146978,"c":1,"x":0.83883495141425402,"w":0.064077669779459612,"t":"Test 3","h":0.013177389222142066},{"y":0.30284403540105442,"w":0.037827011744181349,"c":1,"h":0.013711729673581807,"t":"Q32","x":0.83068672374497587},{"w":0.03689320246378569,"h":0.01308139551465759,"t":"Q33","c":1,"x":0.83106796178320952,"y":0.33575581383424091},{"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"t":"Q34","x":0.83300970935063134,"y":0.39244186034373141,"w":0.036893202463785912},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"c":1,"h":0.014534883112922281,"x":0.83300970936205332,"t":"Q35","y":0.4404069770054404},{"t":"Q36","y":0.55247594175026105,"h":0.01664996043172573,"x":0.83200164974853574,"c":1,"w":0.040958201090494861},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"c":1,"y":0.62645348860342265,"x":0.83495145699140794,"t":"Q37","h":0.014534883112922281},{"t":"Q38","y":0.67587209290400851,"x":0.83495145692884065,"w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.013081395514657479,"c":1},{"x":0.83689320449086868,"w":0.036893202463785912,"t":"Q39","y":0.83575581383424113,"h":0.013081395514657479,"c":1},{"x":0.83689320450165605,"t":"Q40","w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.01308139551465759,"y":0.89244186034586892,"c":1},{"h":0.01453488311292217,"c":1,"y":0.95348837225167837,"t":"113","x":0.86990291346713622,"w":0.036893202463785801}]}